; First Steps in Amharic / አማርኛ (am)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

አንቀሳቅስ box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
ጨምር box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
ቀንስ box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
ሲስተም_ጥራ box         ; Show the final candy count!
